# ################################################################################################################################

User opens:
https://shop.example.com

↓
Route53 resolves DNS

↓
AWS ALB receives HTTPS traffic

↓
ALB forwards to Istio Ingress Gateway

↓
Istio checks VirtualService

↓
Routes to frontend service

↓
Frontend Pod receives request

↓
Frontend calls payment-service internally

↓
Istio sidecars secure communication using mTLS

↓
Response returned to user